 ],
 "strings": {
  "With you gone, he could consolidate his power.\nAt least that's how he saw it.": "",
  "With you gone, he could take control of the family.\nThat's how he saw it.": "",
  "And he wasn't wrong.\nJust look at it now.": "",
  "And he wasn't wrong.\nI mean, just look at it now.": "",
  "Yeah. Nobody can stand up\nto the captain anymore.": "",
  "...Nobody can stand up to the captain anymore.\nHe's running the show.": "",
  "With the power and money he's got?\nHe's the only thing keeping us afloat.": "",
  "And with all that power and money, why wouldn't he?\nHe's the only thing keeping us afloat.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So Hamura staged a robbery\nand pinned it on Kaito-san to get him expelled.)</color> ": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(But if Higashi knows all that,\nwhy's he at Hamura's beck and call?)</color> ": "",
  "How exactly did Red Nose die?": "",
  "And what happened to Red Nose?\nHow'd he die?": "",
  "You know...\nDon't you, Higashi?": "",
  "You know, don't you, Higashi?": "",
  "It was the day after the 100 mil went missing.\nAfter Kaito-aniki got expelled.": "",
  "It was the day after the hundred mil went missing.\nAfter Kaito-aniki got expelled.": "",
  "I bought some info from a dirty cop.\nLed me right to the name Red Nose.": "",
  "I bought some info from a dirty cop, did some digging...\nLed me right to the name Red Nose.": "",
  "I asked all around town,\n'til eventually I ended up down in the sewers.": "",
  "I asked all around town,\n'til I ended up down in Kamurocho's sewers.": "",
  "But me and Red Nose...\nWe weren't the only two there.": "",
  "But, turns out...\nRed Nose wasn't the only one there.": "",
  "You found Hamura, didn't you?": "",
  "...Captain Hamura, too?": "",
  "They were making a deal. Hamura was gonna get 90 mil,\nand Red Nose would've walked away alive.": "",
  "Yeah. Sounded like Hamura was gonna get 90 mil,\nand Red Nose would've walked away alive.": "",
  "And 10 million yen richer, at that.\nIt should've all been wrapped up, clean and easy...": "",
  "Not to mention 10 million yen richer.\nIt should've all been wrapped up, clean and easy...": "",
  "So you really didn't kill him, huh?": "",
  "So... you really didn't kill him, huh?": "",
  "No. But... people know I was\nout looking for him.": "",
  "No. But that's not worth much.\nPeople know I was out searching the city for Red Nose.": "",
  "My prints're all over the gun, too.": "",
  "No matter how you look at it,\nI don't got an alibi.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(True. The cops probably <font_kind=yakuza_italic>would</font_kind> suspect him.)</color> ": "",
  "You said it yourself.\nI look like a real yakuza now.": "",
  "You said it yourself.\nI look like a real yakuza now, right?": "",
  "I was thinking the same thing.": "",
  "Funny. I was thinking the same thing.": "",
  "Hey, what if we told Matsugane-san about this?\nThink he could put the squeeze on Hamura?": "",
  "Hey, what if we told Matsugane-san about this?\nThink he could put the squeeze on the captain?": "",
  "Not a chance.\nThe boss can't stop him anymore.": "",
  "Telling him would just\nmake things worse.": "",
  "That's why Higashi kept it a secret.\nTough as it sounds, it was the right move.": "",
  "Even though Higashi knew, he didn't have a choice.\nHad to keep it secret.": "",
  "Right.\nHell of a thing.": "",
  "...Right.\nThat's too bad.": "",
  "All right, I'm gonna go, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Well, I'm gonna go, Kaito-san.": "",
  "This is between the two of you now.\nI'm sure you've got a lot to catch up on.": "",
  "You two have a lot to catch up on, right? It's fine.\nI don't wanna get in the way.": "",
  "Not sure what it is.\nI just... can't stand that guy.": "",
  "Not sure why...\nBut I can't stand that guy.": "",
  "I mean, he's known you way longer than I have.\nAnd the boss has his back even though he never swore up.": "",
  "I mean, he's known you way longer than I have.\nAnd the boss has his back, even though he never swore up.": "",
  "I dunno.\nSomething's just off about him.": "",
  "I dunno, guy just gets under my skin.": "",
  "Hey. You ever hear what\nhappened to his dad?": "",
  "...Higashi. You never heard about\nTak's dad, right?": "",
  "Nope. What happened?": "",
  "Nope.\nWhat happened?": "",
  "Lemme start from the beginning.\nFrom what I've heard, he was a stand-up guy.": "",
  "Lemme start from the beginning.\nHe's the one who taught Tak martial arts.": "",
  "Taught him kung-fu and everything.": "",
  "Sounded like a real standup guy.": "",
  "He was a lawyer, too.": "",
  "And, well... he was a lawyer, too.": "",
  "Things changed when Tak was fifteen.": "",
  "But things changed when Tak was fifteen.": "",
  "His dad took on a dead-to-rights murder case,\nand actually managed to get an acquittal. ": "",
  "One of the victim's relatives\nwasn't too happy about that, though...": "",
  "But, uh... one of the victim's relatives\nwasn't too happy about that.": "",
  "Oh...": "",
  "When Tak was younger,\nboth his parents were stabbed to death.": "",
  "Tak's parents... were stabbed to death\nwith a kitchen knife.": "",
  "Tak was at a friend's house\nwhen it happened.": "",
  "Back then, Tak kinda resented his parents for\nthe long hours they were working...": "",
  "He was crashing at a friend's house\nwhen it all went down.": "",
  "But maybe if he'd been home...\nMaybe he could've done something. Anything.": "",
  "But if he had been home...\nMaybe he could've stopped the killer.": "",
  "Maybe his parents would still be alive.": "",
  "Maybe they'd still be alive.": "",
  "So this guy who killed the family...\nThey ever catch him?": "",
  "So this guy kills the Yagamis, and then what?\nThey caught him?": "",
  "He hung himself at the scene of the crime.\n\"Tragic\" doesn't even begin to describe it.": "",
  "Hung himself at the scene of the crime.\n\"Tragic\" hardly describes it.": "",
  "Tak ended up comin' to Kamurocho right after that.\nDidn't want any help from his relatives, neither.": "",
  "Not long after that, Tak left the rest of his\nfamily behind and came to Kamurocho.": "",
  "So, he lied about his age\nand snagged a job at Tender.": "",
  "He lied about his age\nand snagged a job at Tender.": "",
  "Got it.\nSo that's when he met you, huh?": "",
  "I see. So... that's where it all began?\nYou met each other there?": "",
  "Yeah. And if you want the truth,\nI wasn't too big on the guy at first either.": "",
  "Yeah, well... If I'm bein' honest,\nI wasn't big on the guy at first either.": "",
  "I was pretty green at the time too.": "",
  "I was pretty green at the time myself.": "",
  "But here comes this 15 year old punk picking a fight\nwith a yakuza my size. The balls on that one.": "",
  "And here comes this 15-year-old-punk\npicking a fight with a yakuza my size.": "",
  "Probably thought he stood a chance.": "",
  "Probably.\n'Til I broke his nose.": "",
  "Probably, 'til I broke his nose.": "",
  "But no matter how much he gets beaten down,\nTak's not the kinda guy to give up.": "",
  "But every time, he bounced back. No matter what you\nthrow at him, he's not the kinda guy to give up.": "",
  "Every time I beat the crap outta him,\nhe'd act like it was no big deal.": "",
  "I'd beat the shit out of him,\nand he'd just brush it off.": "",
  "Then one day, and I couldn't tell you why...\nMatsugane-san took a shine to him.": "",
  "Then one day, I dunno why...\nMatsugane-san took a shine to him.": "",
  "This weird father-son thing just kinda happened.\nTak wouldn't listen to anyone else.": "",
  "And Tak gradually started\nactually listening to the old man.": "",
  "For me n' you, becoming yakuza was our only choice.\nBut for him? It was different.": "",
  "He was different. Guys like us got the yakuza\nlife in our blood, but not him.": "",
  "And if I had to guess, the boss could see that,\nand that's why he took him in.": "",
  "If I had to guess, that's probably why\nthe boss decided to take him in.": "",
  "Tak didn't let him down, though.\nEnded up passing the bar exam not long after.": "",
  "Tak didn't let him down, though.\nPassed the bar exam not long after.": "",
  "I remember.\nWasn't too pleased with it myself.": "",
  "I remember being kinda\npissed about that, myself.": "",
  "But that's all in the past.\nIt's different now.": "",
  "But it doesn't matter.\nThat's all in the past.": "",
  "He's a dead man walking.": "",
  "Yagami's a dead man walking now.": "",
  "What do you and Matsugane-san\nstill see in him?": "",
  "I dunno. What do you and Matsugane-san\nstill see in him?": "",
  "I could ask the same question about a guy\nwho got kicked out for letting his safe get robbed.": "",
  "Well, I mean... What do <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> see in a guy who\ngot kicked out for letting his safe get robbed?": "",
  "Kamurocho chews up guys like us.": "",
  "Just another day in Kamurocho.": "",
  "And when it spits you out,\nyou're right back on the street.": "",
  "It chews us up and spits us\nright back out.": "",
  "But me and him, we grew up here.\nWe don't have another home.": "",
  "But me and him... We grew up here.\nGot nowhere else to go.": "",
  "So even if it means butting heads with Captain Hamura...\nWe're gonna see this shit through.": "",
  "So no matter how much we gotta butt heads with Hamura...\nwe're gonna do this our way.": "",
  "Aniki.": "",
  "The captain's word is absolute,\nat least for now.": "",
  "As it stands now...\nCaptain Hamura's word is absolute.": "",
  "But if he ever gave the order\nto off you...": "",
  "But if he ever told me to off you...": "",
  "I might have to think twice about it.": "",
  "Maybe I'd have to think twice.": "",
  "I think I can live with that.": "",
  "Glad to hear.\nI'll take it.": "",
  "One dead, one wounded in the Tojo Clan's\nMatsugane office shooting...": "",
  "\"One Dead, One Wounded in\nMatsugane Office Shooting\"...": "",
  "Dead guy's name was Kurimoto.\nBeen in the family for years.": "",
  "Did I know him?": "",
  "Kurimoto?": "",
  "Doubt it. He didn't make a habit\nof standing out.": "",
  "Eh, I don't think you'd know him.\nHe didn't make a habit of standing out.": "",
  "At least they got the killer.\nApparently he says he's just an office worker.": "",
  "At least they got the killer.\nHe claims he's just an office worker.": "",
  "Bullshit. Guy's a Kyorei assassin,\nno doubt.": "",
  "Yup. Least, that's what\nHigashi told me.": "",
  "Oh, you mean the guy who was ready\nto shoot me the other day?": "",
  "Right... You mean, the guy\nwho was ready to shoot me?": "",
  "You still sore about that?": "",
  "You still sore 'bout that?": "",
  "Anyway. According to Higashi, this guy shot\nKurimoto three times in the torso.": "",
  "According to Higashi, this guy shot\nKurimoto four times in the torso.": "",
  "Then...\nHe shot both his eyes out.": "",
  "But why?": "",
  "Must be the Kyorei's idea of revenge.": "",
  "Must be the Kyorei's idea of taking\nrevenge on the Mole.": "",
  "If things keep going like this though...\nEven the Tojo Clan proper might end up getting involved.": "",
  "But if this keeps escalating,\nit might go all the way up to the Tojo Clan proper.": "",
  "So the Kyorei Clan wants a war.": "",
  "So the Kyorei Clan's trying to\nstart a war, huh?": "",
  "Looks like it.\nKamurocho's turning into a goddamn battlefield.": "",
  "Yep. Kamurocho's turning into a goddamn battlefield.\nSo Higashi says, anyway.": "",
  "...Yagami?": "",
  "Huh...? Yagami!?": "",
  "What're you doing here?": "",
  "Hey— Wh-What're you doing here?": "",
  "Just here to chat.": "",
  "Just came to chat.": "",
  "To chat!?\nIf Captain Hamura knew this, he'd...": "",
  "You want a \"chat\"!?\nIf Hamura saw you here, he'd...": "",
  "Never mind.\nDon't gotta worry about that now.": "",
  "Never mind. Don't gotta\nworry about that now.": "",
  "He's in no position to be\ncomin' after you anymore.": "",
  "You mean 'cause of the shooting?": "",
  "Yeah, it really shook him up.\nHe's been MIA ever since that night.": "",
  "Yup. Ever since it happened,\nthe captain's been totally MIA.": "",
  "Went into hiding even before the cops came.": "",
  "Went into hiding even\nbefore the cops came.": "",
  "So? Whaddya want?": "",
  "So?\nWhaddya want?": "",
  "Don't just stand there.\nYou're a guest. Take a seat.": "",
  "It's rude to keep a guest standing.\nSit down, would ya?": "",
  "Didn't you wanna talk about\nsomething? Take a seat.": "",
  "Didn't you wanna talk about something?\nTake a seat.": "",
  "Higashi was in the office\nwhen the shooting happened.": "",
  "Probably wouldn't hurt to swing\nby the arcade and get the scoop.": "",
  "If you want my opinion, it couldn't hurt\nto swing by the arcade.": "",
  "I heard someone got shot at\nthe Matsugane Family Office last night.": "",
  "Was it someone you knew?": "",
  "Was it someone you knew, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Nah, just a name I'd heard.": "",
  "No, nobody I'd met.": "",
  "Wait, were you actually worried about me?": "",
  "Wait. Were you worried about me?": "",
  "Nope. Not at all.": "",
  "No, not especially.": "",
  "Great.": "",
  "Oh. Okay.": "",
  "You sure you don't wanna start\npracticing again, Yagami?": "",
  "Say, Yagami. You sure you don't\nwanna start practicing again?": "",
  "We've had so many new clients lately.\nWe don't have the manpower to deal with them all!": "",
  "We've had so many new clients lately.\nWe don't have the manpower to deal with this!": "",
  "You think it's 'cause\nShintani won that case?": "",
  "Lucky you. Think it's 'cause\nShintani won that case?": "",
  "Uh-huh.": "",
  "Though that was almost entirely\nbecause of you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Either way, Shintani's reputation\nhas really skyrocketed.": "",
  "Either way, Shintani-sensei's reputation\nhas skyrocketed since then.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami.": "",
  "Are you butting heads with Hamura?\nHe called me to complain about it.": "",
  "You and Hamura are butting heads, yeah?\nHe called me, specifically to complain about you.": "",
  "Said to keep your nose out of his case.": "",
  "The captain wants you off his case.": "",
  "Oh... Sorry about that.": "",
  "Yeah, sorry about that.": "",
  "Fine by me. Just wanted\nto make sure you're okay.": "",
  "It's fine by me.\nJust wanted to make sure you're okay.": "",
  "I'm good. He's a little\npreoccupied now anyway.": "",
  "Yeah. He's a little preoccupied\nat the moment, anyway.": "",
  "There was a shooting\nat the Matsugane Family office.": "",
  "Last night, someone got shot\noutside the Matsugane office.": "",
  "Yeah, I heard. This damn city\ngets rougher every day...": "",
  "For crying out loud...\nKamurocho's getting rougher every day.": "",
  "Move along!\nNothing to see here!": "",
  "Nothing to see here!\nCome on, keep moving! Keep moving!": "",
  "(This place is a mess.\nMakes sense after the shooting last night...)": "",
  "(I wonder what Hoshino-kun was talking about.\nOnly one way to find out.)": "",
  "Sounds like the family's\na mess right now.": "",
  "Sounds like the Matsugane Family's\na mess right now.": "",
  "Got that right.\nThe office is crawling with cops.": "",
  "Yeah. The office is crawling with cops.": "",
  "Gonna head over there myself\nonce I'm done with this.": "",
  "Gonna head over there myself\nin a bit.": "",
  "Gotta shore up the defensive line.": "",
  "Gotta shore up defenses.": "",
  "The whole family's on duty\nfor this shit.": "",
  "Right. I'm just wondering...\nWhy'd the Kyorei decide to come after you now?": "",
  "Makes sense. I gotta wonder...\nWhy are the Kyorei so worked up all of a sudden?": "",
  "They've been pretty quiet.": "",
  "They've been pretty quiet\nup until now.": "",
  "It's obvious. Their second-in-command's\nin town and ready for war.": "",
  "Because their number two just got into Kamurocho,\nand he's ready for war.": "",
  "Took the train up from Kansai\nand everything.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I was thinking the same thing.": "ฉันก็คิดแบบเดียวกันเลย",
  "Oh...": "โอ้...",
  "Aniki.": "อานิกิ",
  "But why?": "แต่ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "What're you doing here?": "พวกแกมาทำอะไรที่นี่?",
  "Great.": "เยี่ยม",
  "Oh. Okay.": "อ๋อ โอเค",
  "Uh-huh.": "อืม-ฮึ",
  "Oh... Sorry about that.": "โอ๊ะ... ขอโทษทีนะ",
  "Yeah, sorry about that.": "อือ ขอโทษด้วยนะ"
 }
}
